WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.585
Living your WHY means that

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:02.960
when we make decisions

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.370
we are conscientious about

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.700
having our WHY front-and-center.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.800
That we consider whether we are helping

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.600
bring our WHY to life or advance our WHY

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:14.600
or not.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.200
Look we can always make the decision
not to

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.835
but I would rather do that consciously

00:00:18.835 --> 00:00:21.000
and know why we're choosing to do it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.669
It's like living a healthy lifestyle

00:00:22.669 --> 00:00:24.200
and choosing to eat chocolate cake.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:24.900
It's totally fine

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.029
but you do it with eyes wide open
knowing that

00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:29.920
you have to work out a little more
over the weekend

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.700
or you just don't do it that often.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.820
So it's the same thing.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.120
WHY provides that focus and direction

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:40.500
so we can live with purpose
on purpose.

